<title>IRAN: Nineteen Iranians killed in a road accident.</title>
<headline>Nineteen Iranians killed in a road accident.</headline>
<dateline>TEHRAN 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nineteen people were killed in a road accident in southern Iran, Ettelaat daily reported on Saturday.</p>
<p>It said the 19 were killed and 18 people injured in a collision between a bus and a truck near Zahedan, 1,600 km (1000 miles) southeast of Tehran.</p>
<p>The paper did not say when the accident took place.</p>
</text>
